hXDP: Efficient Software Packet Processing on FPGA NICs (Brunella et al., 2020)
Method: Offloads eBPF programs directly onto FPGA hardware (SmartNICs).
Dataset: Synthetic packet processing traces
Advantages: Achieves hardware-level speeds with zero host CPU usage.
Limitations: Requires expensive, specialized FPGA hardware.
Research Gap: Achieving near-hardware packet processing on standard cloud servers.
Possible Improvements: Delivers near-hardware speeds using pure software eBPF on standard AWS EC2 nodes.
